<title>USA: Unitog says completes Detroit acquisition.</title>
<headline>Unitog says completes Detroit acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unitog Co said it completed the acquisition of uniform rental routes in Detroit, Mich., to be serviced from existing facilities.</p>
<p>The purchase is expected to add about $2 million in annual rental revenues, the uniform manufacturing and rental firm said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
